 "rule": "count: on Oʻahu the City’s footprints of 30 m and over (lidar of 2005 and 2009, or the City’s later heights), one building to footprints whose centres lie within 30 m, with the towers CTBUH lists as completed from 2010 on that none of them stands within 40 m of; elsewhere OpenStreetMap’s buildings of ten levels or 30 m and over. share: the ACS 2019–2023 units in structures of 50 or more by the year built (B25127), the bands split into decades by the same tracts’ units by decade built (B25034), linear within a decade; where CTBUH dates fifteen or more of an area’s towers, the mean of that and the share of them completed by the year; none before 1955; the island’s own where an area has fewer than a hundred such units.",
